@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #243247
skinparam ArrowColor #53657A
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #E2EDFC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BDAA65
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #60758A
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #A5B1BE
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #8D9BAD
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F4F6F9
title Editing a personal expense: "edit 3 a/120 c/food"
participant "app: TripJio" as App #E8EDF3
participant "c: EditCommand" as Cmd #E2EDFC
participant "expenses:\nExpenseList" as List #E3F3EF
participant "e: Expense" as Exp #E3F3EF
participant "ui: Ui" as Ui #EFE6F8

activate App
App -> Cmd : execute(state, ui)
activate Cmd
Cmd -> List : get(3)
activate List
List --> Cmd : e
deactivate List
opt a/ was given
Cmd -> Exp : setAmount(120)
activate Exp
note right
  subclass rule;
  may throw
end note
Exp --> Cmd
deactivate Exp
end
note over Cmd, Exp : The amount is changed first: if it is rejected,\nno other field has been changed yet.
opt d/, c/ or dt/ was given
Cmd -> Exp : set other fields(...)
activate Exp
Exp --> Cmd
deactivate Exp
end
Cmd -> Exp : getMonth()
activate Exp
Exp --> Cmd : month
deactivate Exp
note right of Cmd : Store month in c.affectedMonth.\nThis is the date after any edit.
Cmd -> Ui : showMessage(...)
activate Ui
Ui --> Cmd
deactivate Ui
Cmd --> App
deactivate Cmd
ref over App, Ui : MonthlyBudgetWarning
note over App, Cmd : The referenced interaction calls c.getAffectedMonth(),\nwhich returns the stored month; saving follows.
deactivate App
@enduml
